00:23:23,532 --> 00:23:26,032
けして汚さない
Never letting it be stained.

321
00:23:26,032 --> 00:23:28,532
守る無二の看板
Protecting our one-and-only reputation.

322
00:23:29,032 --> 00:23:31,532
気取られない根回し oh yeah
Unnoticed behind-the-scenes groundwork, oh yeah.

323
00:23:31,532 --> 00:23:34,532
お見舞いする後の祭り oh yeah
Too late to regret once we're done, oh yeah.

324
00:23:34,532 --> 00:23:37,032
響くヒールの音がお仕置きの合図
The echoing sound of heels is the signal for punishment.

325
