爪を剥き出し beat you
Baring our claws to beat you.

337
00:24:14,032 --> 00:24:18,532
たかが企業もどきと侮るのなら
If you look down on us as just some mock corporation.

338
00:24:18,532 --> 00:24:24,032
タガが外れて容赦できなくなって やばっ！炸裂！
We'll lose our minds and show no mercy, oh no! Explosion!

339
00:24:24,032 --> 00:24:27,032
本音かまし 弱音なんてすぐねんね
Letting out our true feelings, putting any weakness right to sleep.

340
00:24:27,032 --> 00:24:30,032
混じり気ないハートビート 揺らすこの世界
A pure heartbeat shaking this world.

341
00:24:30,032 --> 00:24:32,532
最果てまで届くよう鳴らした鐘
Ringing the bell so it reaches the ends of the earth.

342
00:24:32,532 --> 00:24:36,032
裏の裏までいただいちゃおう
Let's take it all, down to the very core of their secrets.

343
00:24:36,032 --> 00:24:39,032
綺羅煌々 狙って bang-ba-bang
Shining brilliantly, aiming bang-ba-bang.

344
00:24:39,032 --> 00:24:41,532
外さない クリア
Never missing, clear.

345
00:24:41,532 --> 00:24:44,032
いざ堂々 目立って run and gun
Boldly and proudly, standing out, run and gun.

346
00:24:44,032 --> 00:24:47,532
未だに他に類を見ない
Still unparalleled elsewhere.

347
00:24:47,532 --> 00:24:50,032
意気揚々 迫って bang-ba-bang
Triumphant, closing in bang-ba-bang.

348
00:24:50,032 --> 00:24:53,032
悟られず カバー
Undetected, cover.

349
00:24:53,032 --> 00:24:55,032
here we go yo 気取ってさぁ出番
Here we go yo, striking a pose, it's our turn.

350
00:24:55,032 --> 00:24:58,532
跡を濁さず take off
Leaving no trace behind, take off.

351
00:24:58,532 --> 00:25:00,032
今日もひみつの take off
Today too, a secret take off.

352
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:01,840
Shoo be do to be do do

353
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:04,240
Shoo be do to be do do

354
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:07,240
Shoo be do to be do do

355
00:25:07,540 --> 00:25:10,540
今日もひみつの Take off
Another secret takeoff today

356
00:25:28,140 --> 00:25:32,340
立派なこの羽に
On these fine wings,

357
00:25:32,340 --> 00:25:37,340
泥をつけて這っていた
I was crawling through the mud,

358
00:25:37,340 --> 00:25:42,540
兼ね備えた爪立てて
with my well-equipped claws dug in.

359
00:25:42,540 --> 00:25:47,340
信じられるものは自分だけだと
Believing that the only one I can trust is myself,

360
00:25:47,340 --> 00:25:52,540
思い込んで進み続けた
I kept pushing forward.

361
