「あのコみたいにすれば？」
"Why don't you do it like that girl?"

362
00:25:55,340 --> 00:25:57,840
「君じゃそれは無理だ」
"It's impossible for you."

363
00:25:57,840 --> 00:26:03,040
言わせておけばいいさ
Let them say what they want.

364
00:26:03,040 --> 00:26:07,840
たった独り 逆境の先
All alone, beyond adversity,

365
00:26:07,840 --> 00:26:12,840
あいつらから奪う歓声
I will steal their cheers.

366
00:26:12,840 --> 00:26:17,840
私の邪魔させやしない
I won't let them stand in my way!

367
00:26:17,840 --> 00:26:22,840
like a 高嶺 見据えた高み
Like a lofty peak, gazing at the heights,

368
00:26:22,840 --> 00:26:27,240
穴ぐらから空へ
from the cave to the sky,

369
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:32,240
飛んでいく私を見ないなんて
how could you not watch me fly away?

370
00:26:32,240 --> 00:26:36,540
bad boy

371
00:27:05,840 --> 00:27:08,540
「あのコはもう終わりだ」
"That girl is done."

372
00:27:08,540 --> 00:27:10,540
「これ以上はないね」
"She won't get any further."

373
00:27:10,540 --> 00:27:15,540
言わせておけばいいさ
Let them say what they want.

374
00:27:15,540 --> 00:27:17,540
いつの日か...
Someday...

375
00:27:17,540 --> 00:27:20,540
寝ても覚めても
whether asleep or awake,

376
00:27:20,540 --> 00:27:24,540
夢見てた大歓声
I've dreamed of the great cheers.

377
00:27:24,540 --> 00:27:27,040
私はここで死にたくない！
I don't want to die here!

378
00:27:27,040 --> 00:27:31,540
一生の旅 逆境の先
A lifelong journey, beyond adversity,

379
00:27:31,540 --> 00:27:36,540
あいつらから奪う歓声
I will steal their cheers.

380
00:27:36,540 --> 00:27:41,540
私の邪魔させやしない
I won't let them stand in my way!

381
00:27:41,540 --> 00:27:46,540
like a 高嶺 見据えた高み
Like a lofty peak, gazing at the heights,

382
00:27:46,540 --> 00:27:51,040
穴ぐらから空へ
from the cave to the sky,

383
00:27:51,040 --> 00:27:56,040
飛んでいく私を見ないなんて
how could you not watch me fly away?

384
00:27:56,040 --> 00:28:00,040
bad boy

385
00:28:31,240 --> 00:28:34,240
誰かに言われなくたって
Even if nobody says so,

386
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:39,240
私の方がもっと嫌いだ
I hate myself even more.

387
00:28:39,540 --> 00:28:41,240
うるさいな
Shut up.

388
00:28:41,540 --> 00:28:45,540
想像が視界を塞いで
Imagination blocks my vision,

389
00:28:45,540 --> 00:28:48,540
惨めな理由を書き連ねる
writing down miserable excuses,

390
00:28:48,540 --> 00:28:52,540
教室にずっと居残り
left behind in the classroom forever.

391
00:28:52,540 --> 00:28:56,540
窓の向こうに黒い影があって
A black shadow stands outside the window,

392
00:28:56,540 --> 00:29:01,540
何も言わずにこっちを見ていた
staring at me without a word.

393
00:29:01,540 --> 00:29:06,040
私は貴方に救われたくて泣くんじゃない
I don't cry because I want you to save me.

394
00:29:06,040 --> 00:29:11,240
産声は止められないもの
The first cry cannot be stopped.

395
00:29:11,540 --> 00:29:16,840
何千回ともう一度死に損なおう
Let's fail to die once again, thousands of times,

396
