希望と絶望の夜中を纏って
cloaked in the midnight of hope and despair.

397
00:29:22,040 --> 00:29:27,240
醜い光を許したのは
The one who forgave the ugly light

398
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:32,040
他ならない私だった
was none other than myself.

399
00:29:32,040 --> 00:29:37,040
息をして
Take a breath...

400
00:29:37,040 --> 00:29:43,540
目を開けて
...and open your eyes.

401
00:29:43,840 --> 00:29:48,540
これが最後かどうか
Whether this is the end or not,

402
00:29:48,540 --> 00:29:52,540
知る術はないよ 知りたくもないよ
I have no way of knowing, nor do I want to know.

403
00:29:52,540 --> 00:29:54,540
優しいな
How kind...

404
00:29:54,540 --> 00:29:59,040
昏々と闇は寄り添って
darkness gently nestles in.

405
