どうせ面白くもないよと
"Anyway, it's not even interesting..."

406
00:30:03,448 --> 00:30:07,448
窓を挟んで微かに聞こえた
I faintly heard it through the window...

407
00:30:07,848 --> 00:30:12,348
それは祈るような啜り泣きだった
...it was a prayer-like sobbing.

408
00:30:12,848 --> 00:30:17,848
私は貴方を救える言葉を知らないけど
I don't know the words to save you, but...

409
00:30:17,848 --> 00:30:21,848
寂しいねって声をかけた
...I called out, "It's lonely, isn't it?"

410
00:30:41,548 --> 00:30:46,048
何千回ともう一度死に損なおう
Let's fail to die once again, thousands of times,

411
00:30:46,348 --> 00:30:51,448
希望と絶望の夜中を纏って
wearing the night of hope and despair.

412
00:30:52,548 --> 00:30:57,048
何千回ともう一度生きる貴方へ
To you who will live once again, thousands of times...

413
00:30:57,048 --> 00:31:02,048
私も続くよ 窓の向こう側で
...I will follow you on the other side of the window.

414
00:31:02,548 --> 00:31:06,848
醜い光を愛せたとき
When we could love the ugly light...

415
00:31:07,048 --> 00:31:13,248
終わらせなかった産声を
...the first cry that we didn't let end...

416
00:31:13,248 --> 00:31:17,048
歌にしよう
...let's turn it into a song.

417
00:31:17,548 --> 00:31:21,548
歌にしよう
Let's turn it into a song.

418
00:31:21,548 --> 00:31:27,548
歌にしよう
Let's turn it into a song.

419
00:31:42,548 --> 00:31:44,848
特報
[Special Announcement]

420
00:31:50,548 --> 00:31:51,948
戦う理由は、一つじゃない
[There is more than one reason to fight]

421
00:31:54,848 --> 00:31:58,548
Lapis Lazuli
[Lapis Lazuli - Takane Lui 2nd Album]

422
00:32:08,848 --> 00:32:13,148
はい、ということで、今、特報を見ていただきましたが、
Yes! So you've just watched the special announcement,

423
00:32:13,148 --> 00:32:17,348
なんと、鷹嶺ルイ、12月3日に
and surprisingly, Takane Lui, on December 3rd...

424
00:32:17,348 --> 00:32:22,048
自身のセカンドアルバム『Lapis Lazuli』を
...will be releasing her second album, "Lapis Lazuli"!

425
00:32:22,048 --> 00:32:27,248
発売することが決定しました！
It has been officially decided!

426
00:32:27,248 --> 00:32:31,948
ふー！いぇーい！
Woo! Yay!

427
00:32:32,448 --> 00:32:34,548
ということで
And so,

428
00:32:34,548 --> 00:32:38,248
なんとですね、今回は鷹嶺史上初の
surprisingly, for the first time in Takane's history,

429
00:32:38,248 --> 00:32:44,048
全国、全国のショップで買える全国流通盤ということで
this will be a nationwide distribution, available at shops all over Japan!

430
00:32:44,048 --> 00:32:47,048
えー、また一つ夢が叶っちゃいました
Ah, another dream of mine has come true,

431
00:32:47,048 --> 00:32:51,248
みんなのおかげです、ありがとう！
all thanks to everyone. Thank you!

432
00:32:51,248 --> 00:32:54,548
えー、ファーストに続きまして、リバティに続きまして、セカンドなんですけども
Following my first album, then Liberty, this is my second,

433
00:32:54,548 --> 00:32:58,248
今回は『Lapis Lazuli』というね、タイトルを付けさせていただきました+
but this time, I've titled it "Lapis Lazuli."

434
00:32:58,248 --> 00:33:02,148
この『Lapis Lazuli』というのはですね
This "Lapis Lazuli" is...

435
00:33:02,148 --> 00:33:05,148
いつも、あの、アルバムには『L』の文字がついてるんですけれども
Well, my albums always have the letter "L" in their title,

436
00:33:05,148 --> 00:33:09,548
えー、今回も『L』の文字から始まる『Lapis Lazuli』という言葉で
so this time too, I chose "Lapis Lazuli" starting with "L."

437
00:33:09,548 --> 00:33:13,548
えー、こちらですね、あの、意味がですね
This word actually has meanings,

438
00:33:13,548 --> 00:33:17,548
えー、成功に導く、だったりとか
such as "leading to success,"

439
00:33:17,548 --> 00:33:22,548
あとは、結構、あの、勝利へと、勝利を掴み取る、みたいな
and also grasping victory, or moving towards victory,

440
00:33:22,548 --> 00:33:27,148
意味合いが込められておりまして
those kinds of meanings are infused into it.

441
00:33:27,148 --> 00:33:31,548
なんと、こちらアルバムはですね、VS、戦いをテーマにした曲になっております
Remarkably, this album contains songs themed around "VS" and conflict,

